WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
In All pages, open Advanced move.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Enter the page range to move. The dialog warns when the destination is inside that selection.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.200
Choose After, enter an included destination page outside the selection, then choose Move pages.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.770
The selected page range moves together to its new position.
